  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qRjo0h9.png\" width=\"822\" height=\"242\" /></p>\n<p>現代風格、靈感源自 Hypixel 的幸運方塊模組，專為 Fabric 打造。</p>\n<p>本模組僅支援伺服器端安裝，這意味著玩家無需在用戶端安裝，即可在設有幸運方塊的伺服器上遊玩。<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FYkDhCe.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"125\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ebiQRVe.gif\" width=\"253\" height=\"122\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wcH30VD.gif\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zeAnXBy.gif\" width=\"144\" height=\"146\" /></p>\n<p>與 Apex Hosting 合作夥伴，點擊下方橫幅即可租用伺服器：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.apexminecrafthosting.com/aff.php?aff=3548\"><img src=\"https://cardboardpowered.org/assets/apex-hosting-mobile.webp\" width=\"780\" height=\"134\" border=\"0\" /></a></p>",
